================================================================================
Summary of Modifications in This Fork
================================================================================
- Added a local offline Web Studio UI (webapp/) built with modern web platform
  standards (native <dialog>, Popover API, CSS @layer / light-dark() /
  @container / :has(), View Transitions, bilingual English / Thai UI).
- Added universal GPU/NPU/CPU hardware acceleration support across NVIDIA CUDA
  (RTX & GTX), AMD Radeon (ROCm & DirectML), Intel Arc (XPU & OpenVINO), Apple
  Silicon (MPS & CoreML), AI NPUs (OpenVINO / DirectML / QNN), and CPU fallback.
- Added cross-platform installers (install.ps1, install.sh), portable launchers
  (Start Studio.cmd, run_webapp.ps1, run_webapp.sh, make_shortcut.ps1), and
  1-click GitHub & upstream updaters (update.ps1, update.sh, Update Studio.cmd,
  plus in-app update endpoints).

All original Apache-2.0 copyright notices, license terms, and attribution from
wiltodelta/remove-ai-watermarks are retained intact.

